# FlightGear spawn args for PX4 SITL (sourced inside the container).
# Edit this file and re-run the sim — no image rebuild needed.
# --vc is knots (30 m/s ≈ 58.3 kn). Altitude uses meters with --units-meters.
# Altitude is MSL meters (LSZH elev ≈419.2 → ~500 m AGL). Match jsb_spawn.xml.
FG_ARGS_EX="--disable-terrasync --in-air --units-meters --altitude=919.2 --vc=58.3"
